[{"id":"1269859151448080384","date":1591592989000,"rawContent":"@benshapiro Whatever it takes to keep our black sisters and brothers from dying.  #BlackLivesMatter.","userId":31403779,"media":null,"username":"sherrilee7","containsBlackLivesMatter":true,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":false,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":1.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":2,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":54,"sumOfClimate":43,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":1.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":0.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1276122422857674752","date":1593086269000,"rawContent":"Oh shut up, the only thing you\u2019re standing up for is racism because a black man chose to bend a knee to protest his American brothers and sisters being murdered by police, you\u2019re never done anything for anyone except your damn ego.  SIT DOWN! #BlackLivesMatter #TrumpKillsUS","userId":31403779,"media":null,"username":"sherrilee7","containsBlackLivesMatter":true,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":false,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":2.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":3,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":54,"sumOfClimate":43,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":2.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":0.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1276372125855748097","date":1593145803000,"rawContent":"@PeterCorless @weijia @DrGJackBrown Sad.  I\u2019m getting pretty sick and tired of people hating folks they\u2019ve never even met, how does that even make sense?  Just because maybe you live in the boondocks and you\u2019ve never seen a black person doesn\u2019t mean you need to hate or fear them am I right?  #BlackLivesMatter","userId":31403779,"media":null,"username":"sherrilee7","containsBlackLivesMatter":true,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":false,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":3.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":4,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":54,"sumOfClimate":43,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":3.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":0.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1285329231984103431","date":1595281343000,"rawContent":"Can you say outloud on TV that \u201cBlack lives matter?\u201d  I\u2019m a 63 year old southern white woman and I\u2019m sick of your divisive bullshit! #BlackLivesMatter but not to Ted Cruz, don\u2019t believe me? Ask him.","userId":31403779,"media":null,"username":"sherrilee7","containsBlackLivesMatter":true,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":false,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":3.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":5,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":54,"sumOfClimate":43,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":3.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":0.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1285779092290383872","date":1595388598000,"rawContent":"@ECMcLaughlin I\u2019m so sorry that happened to you.  #MeToo.","userId":31403779,"media":null,"username":"sherrilee7","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":4.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":5,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":55,"sumOfClimate":43,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":3.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":1.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1286025915387072515","date":1595447446000,"rawContent":"\u201cProactively\u201d arresting people means they\u2019re arresting them before they commit a crime.  I\u2019ve never broken a law in my life except one traffic ticket, I\u2019m pro law and order but they are overstepping their bounds and have been for a long time. #BlackLivesMatter","userId":31403779,"media":null,"username":"sherrilee7","containsBlackLivesMatter":true,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":false,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":5.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":6,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":55,"sumOfClimate":43,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":4.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLives